N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations> </citations> </technical-data> <parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HAYAKAWA MOTOMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HONDA KATSUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOSUDA TSUKASA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAYAKAWA, MOTOMU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HONDA, KATSUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOSUDA, TSUKASA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HAYAKAWA MOTOMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HONDA KATSUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOSUDA TSUKASA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HAYAKAWA, MOTOMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HONDA, KATSUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOSUDA, TSUKASA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An electronic device for charging a device to be charged that has a storage battery capable of being repetitively charged, comprising a charging section for charging the storage battery on the basis of a charge control signal, and a charge control section. The charge control section monitors the battery voltage (or charge current) and maintains the charge time effective per unit time for a long time if the battery voltage (or charge current) of the storage battery is less than a preselected limiter voltage (or the charge current corresponding to the limiter voltage). However, after the battery voltage (or charge current) has reached the limiter voltage (or the charge current corresponding to the limiter voltage), the charge control section shortens the charge time effective per unit time.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif électronique conçu pour charger un dispositif à charger qui est muni d'une batterie rechargeable comprenant une partie de chargement destinée à charger la batterie sur la base d'un signal de commande de chargement et une partie de commande de chargement. La partie de commande de chargement surveille la tension (ou le courant) de chargement et maintient un temps de chargement effectif par unité de temps pendant une période plus longue si la tension (ou le courant) de chargement de la batterie est inférieure à une tension limite présélectionnée (ou à un courant limite correspondant à la tension limite présélectionnée). Une fois cependant que la tension (ou le courant) de chargement de la batterie a atteint la tension limite présélectionnée (ou le courant limite correspondant à la tension limite présélectionnée), la partie de commande de chargement raccourcit le temps de chargement effectif par unité de temps.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>